    <solution><m>a=7</m> and
<m>b=3</m>. Hence,
<m>c=\sqrt{{7}^{2}-{3}^{2}}=\sqrt{40} \approx 6.325</m>.



The foci are at
<m>{F}_{1}=\left(-6.325,0\right)</m> and
<m>{F}_{2}=\left(6.325,0\right)</m>, 

 and the vertices are
<m>\left(7,0\right),\left(-7,0\right)</m>,
<m>\left(0,3\right),\left(0,-3\right)</m>.



